# Sample Logo Placeholder

To use logos, place your PNG, JPG, or other image files in this folder.

For testing purposes, you can create a simple logo using any image editor and save it as `logo.png` in this directory.

Example filenames:
- logo.png
- company-logo.png
- brand.png
- watermark.png

Then use them in your API calls:
```
?logo=logo.png&logoPos=upper-right
```
